-- NOTE: For space efficiency, only showing structure for modules 4-10
-- In full implementation, each module would have all objects like modules 1-3:
-- - 16 cell voltages (mod4-cell1-voltage through mod4-cell16-voltage, etc.)
-- - 7 temperature sensors (mod4-temp1 through mod4-ambient-temp, etc.)
-- - 14 pack information objects (mod4-cell-max-voltage through mod4-running-state, etc.)
-- - 11 alarm objects (mod4-cell-overvoltage-alarms through mod4-soc-low-alarm, etc.)
-- - 6 parameter objects (mod4-cell-overvoltage-alarm-value through mod4-soc-low-alarm-value, etc.)

